  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「こらぁっ、逃げるなっち！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「あぁもう、しゃっちんってば——逃げ足だけは年々、速くなるっちね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「陸地での追い駆けっこじゃあ、うちはもう勝ち目ないっち」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「ん？　あぁ、あんたたしか生徒会の使い走りの——名前はなんつったっけ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「まぁいいや、あちこちで色んなお手伝いしてるんだっち？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「じゃあ、ちょっと頼まれてくれないっちか。これこれ、この着ぐるみをつけてほしいんっちよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「よしよし、素直っちね。ちゃんと着れたっち？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「んじゃ、どぼ〜んっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「あはは、いきなり突き落としてごめんっち！　あんまり藻掻くとほんきで溺れるっちよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「だいじょうぶ、防水加工しておいたから浸水しないはずだっち、あんまり動くと酸素なくなって窒息するっちよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「そうそう、そこの穴から呼吸して——じょうず、じょうず♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「んじゃ、うちも失礼するっち。どぼ〜んっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「はいはい、動かなくていいから浮いててほしいっち。うん、いい具合——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「うちが引っぱるっちから、いっしょに泳いでほしいっち」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「うん、これイルカの着ぐるみっち。美術部に頼んで、かなりリアルなのをつくってもらったっちよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「うち、将来は水族館でイルカのトレーナーになりたいっちよ。その予行練習ってわけっち」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「しゃっちん——後輩なんかは、『先輩は泳ぎの天才なんですから！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「遊んでないでもっと速度を追究して欲しいですし！』とか言うっちけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「うちはただ海の生き物と仲良く泳ぎたいっちよ、のんびりとね〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「うちは、できることなら——イルカに生まれたかったっちよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「進路とか、水泳部の記録とか、人間関係とか、いろんなものから自由になって。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「呑気に、プランクトンとか食べて暮らしたかったっち」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「って、あれ？　何か反応ないけど、生きてるっち？　あれ〜っ、息してない？　ちょっと、だいじょうぶっち？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「ごめんね。自由に生きたいうちが、ひとを不自由にしちゃ本末転倒っちよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「ありがとう——いっしょに泳いでくれて、ちょっと気が楽になったっち♪」"
  }
]